  "prefLabel": "Lab 705.02 Subsequent Requests",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 705.02 Subsequent Requests. Authorization for additional independent examination regarding the same injury shall be granted only if the commissioner finds that circumstances exist which cast reasonable doubt on the accuracy of the report of the first independent examination based upon the circumstances of the particular case and any written material which contradicts the first independent exam or the circumstances surrounding that exam.\n\nSource.. #7338, eff 8-2-00; ss by #9217, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12013, eff 10-25-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab700.html"
